{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/349708-solar-character-brainstorming-help","id":349708,"title":"Solar character brainstorming help","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-25T03:01:53-08:00","id":349708,"title":"Solar character brainstorming help","content":"1. Is a character whose major motivation is reforming spirit courts, from the small to the great, to be efficient, incorrupt, and diligent in their duties better suited to being a Zenith or an Eclipse? Zenith fits the religious zeal and reformer-prophet aspect, but Eclipse has the administrator aspects more strongly built in.<br /> <br /> 2. Is the Infernal Charm Sublimation of Ordained Purpose sufficiently within the Solar wheelhouse as Lawgivers that a similar custom Charm might reasonably be constructed (assuming it doesn't actually exist in Ex3)? Do Your Damn Job Prana is obviously an effect this character would like to have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Solar Kitten","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3907-aretii","name":"Aretii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T04:43:04-08:00","id":349766,"title":"","content":"1) Yes<br /> 2) Given it's just an undodgeable social attack, I don't see why not, but your standard solar charms already give you that functionality. Probably better too.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T11:42:46-08:00","id":349976,"title":"","content":"As to (1) - you could build this character in any Caste. Motivations are not intended to be Caste-specific, though certainly some Caste Abilities might make this easier than others. Of course, that's what Favoreds are for. A Dawn who frees his village from the tyrannical grasp of a local god and who sets out to reform the whole system is a viable concept for this, as is a Night who wants to blackmail the gods into behaving better and giving him other benefits on the side.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}